event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":87,"item_id":"rs_023b4950308a9cc7016ac933bd1ee48190abfbd70e30786ece","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Verifying server setup**\n\nI need to check that my browser hasn’t installed anything external, as probably just node tests are enough. I'll build the tests and restart the temporary port using port 0 to choose a reserved free port via net, then start that up. The easiest option is to spawn the server with a randomized port between 20000. I'll also check for readiness errors and test HTTP assets for static surfaces. Let's get this working right!"}

